{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a high-score first-person shooter, where you play as a tree on a journey to save the forest from an evil wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes 1 level, as well as a tutorial and a story intro. There is a single weapon and no online multiplayer. There is an online leader-board, as well as 6 enemies and a randomized item shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has two abilities that can be switched out with a shop item, and the demo is only a high-score FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the full release of this game (Not included in the demo), there are plans for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Online Coop with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Campaign to play solo or with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A hub-world with quests or options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Difficulty modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Infinite high-score mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-New shop items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-New enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-New weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Additional accessibility options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154850?t=1762810042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154850/174482ce18913d61549ed59e2fe94f888213d82b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762810042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154850/0d00555b78e5b3f2da0782fdf5bec50a1ca30470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762810042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154850/0d00555b78e5b3f2da0782fdf5bec50a1ca30470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762810042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id"